# Registers this module's codec provider for ServiceLoader on the class path.
#
# module-info.java declares the same provider with a `provides` directive, and the
# JVM honors that only when this jar is on the module path. An application that
# puts it on the class path - still the default for most - finds no provider at
# all, and resolution fails with "No LayoutCodecProvider implementation was
# found. Add a runtime dependency that provides one." even though the dependency
# is present.
#
# Keep this in step with module-info.java: renaming the provider in one place and
# not the other leaves one of the two paths silently broken.
software.coley.bentofx.persistence.impl.codec.xml.provider.XmlLayoutCodecProvider
